<title>USA: Ceridian buys Washington Consulting.</title>
<headline>Ceridian buys Washington Consulting.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceridian Corp said Monday it had acquired Washington Consulting Services &amp; Technologies Inc. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Washington Consulting had revenues of $1.3 million in its fiscal year ended September 30. It provides software and consulting services on human resources issues.</p>
<p>Ceridian is an information technology and defense electronics company.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
